{% elif lang == 'go' %}
### Go

```bash
go test -race -shuffle=on -count=1 -coverprofile=coverage.out ./...
golangci-lint run && gosec ./... && govulncheck ./...
```

{% elif lang == 'rust' %}
### Rust

```bash
cargo test
cargo fmt --check && cargo clippy -- -D warnings
```

{% elif lang == 'dotnet' %}
### .NET

```bash
dotnet test
dotnet format --verify-no-changes
dotnet build --no-restore
```

